      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IN THE JUNGLE (5) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten a neck (25.67) behind Hara's Sandor at this track. One of the leading chances. CRYSTAL DAYS (6) is a strong stayer who excels over the longer races. Finished second latest over 550m at this track (30.75) in a Grade 4/5 but is better suited over the extra ground. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expected to feature. SEGER (1) turned spotting a big start finishing sixth (31.10) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Should be in this for a long way. HAPPY SHIRTS (8) is not to be discarded.",
